4. What is the N+1 query problem? Write one line of code that causes it and the one-line fix.
   N + 1 query problem occurs when the data fetched through the model realtionship makes new query for each number of record instead of using a single query. We use with and load to fix the N + 1 query problems which uses the where in clause to fetch the data instead of making new query for each record.

$Employee::departments->get(); // This causes the N+1 query problem.
$Employee::with('departments'); // This fixes the N+1 query problem.

